  "description": "One day, a cat named \"Thanks\" encounters a homeless person. \"Thanks\" naturally names the human he brought home \"Yangji\", and starts to live with her. Since he's raising a human for the first time, there are a lot of new things that Thanks has to learn.\n\nThe beautiful (!) daily life of Yangji, who's hopelessly full of energy, and Thanks, an inexperienced owner, begins!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Comico Korea](https://www.comico.kr/comic/1784) (formerly JusToon)  \nPromotional Twitter",
